  "definition": "Commercial vessel",
  "effectiveDate": "2013-03-20",
  "historyNote": "#3010, eff 5-2-85; ss by #4562, eff 1-3-89; ss by #5862, eff 7-1-94, EXPIRED: 7-1-00 New. #7798, eff 12-3-02; ss by #8172, eff 9-21-04; ss by #10293, eff 3-20-13",
